Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:34.46,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“A few hundred dollars of
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:34.46,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}Twitter ads to GitHub got
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:34.46,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}the first 100 stars”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,We actually did
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:01.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,something kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:02.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,clever, which is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,we were in YC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:05.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,we just pivoted to just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,building PostHog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,And we spent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:08.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,a couple hundred bucks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:12.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,on Twitter ads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:13.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and honestly it was some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.91,0:00:14.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:15.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,we did this for a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:15.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,our pivots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:16.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,but it was some of our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:17.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,best converting ads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:18.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,just like a link to our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:19.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,GitHub, because it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:20.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,didn't feel like an ad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:20.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,do you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:22.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,it just felt like kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:22.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,of an interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:23.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,project that someone was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:25.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,sharing. That got us our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:26.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,first like hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:27.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,stars, and then when we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:28.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,launched on Hacker News
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:29.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,it already felt like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,project that had some
